OL,3,GNEWSAFurther delays for major council
OL,4,Aoverhaul in nine of 14 proposed areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has announced further
OL,7,Fdelays to nine of 14 major council
OL,8,Fmergers, with only five now going
OL,9,Fahead.
OL,11,FProposals for 14 regions to undergo
OL,12,Fmergers of smaller councils to form
OL,13,Flarger unitary authorities was put on
OL,14,Fhold by Local Government Secretary
OL,15,FAngela Rayner last month, following
OL,16,Fconcerns around legal challenges.
OL,18,FLocal Government Minister Jim McMahon
OL,19,Fhas told MPs the review had found the
OL,20,Fgovernment's decision-making to be
OL,21,F"robust", but nine areas have now been
OL,22,Fwithdrawn for further review.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
