OL,3,GNEWSAFurther delays for major council
OL,4,Aoverhaul in nine of 14 proposed areas
OL,5,
OL,6,FOnly five of the original 14 regions
OL,7,Fwill be taken forward, after three more
OL,8,Fweeks of consultation. Shadow local
OL,9,Fgovernment secretary Katie Lam
OL,10,Fcondemned the latest news as "a farce".
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
